 "label": "PROVISIONAL_ASR_NOT_LISTENING",
 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 2.28,
   "text": "This is one of the most popular questions submitted to What If.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.133,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 2.52,
   "end": 5.96,
   "text": "What would happen if everyone on Earth stood as close to each other as they could, jumped,",
   "avg_logprob": -0.133,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 6.3,
   "end": 7.84,
   "text": "and landed on the ground at the same instant?",
   "avg_logprob": -0.133,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 8.28,
   "end": 11.46,
   "text": "At the start of the scenario, the entirety of Earth's population has been magically",
   "avg_logprob": -0.133,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 11.46,
   "end": 13.18,
   "text": "transported together into one place.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.133,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 13.56,
   "end": 15.72,
   "text": "This crowd takes up an area the size of Rhode Island.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.133,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 16.08,
   "end": 19.96,
   "text": "In fact, let's assume they, I mean, we, are actually in Rhode Island.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.133,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 20.3,
   "end": 22.12,
   "text": "At the stroke of noon, everyone jumps.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.133,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 22.68,
   "end": 25.2,
   "text": "As discussed elsewhere, this jump doesn't really affect the planet.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.133,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 25.46,
   "end": 27.48,
   "text": "Earth outweighs us by a factor of over 10 trillion.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.133,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 28.04,
   "end": 30.78,
   "text": "The Earth would still only be pushed down by less than an atom's width.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.141,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.02
  },
  {
   "start": 31.62,
   "end": 33.1,
   "text": "Next, everyone falls back to the ground.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.141,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.02
  },
  {
   "start": 33.6,
   "end": 36.56,
   "text": "Technically, this delivers a lot of energy into the Earth, but it's spread out over",
   "avg_logprob": -0.141,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.02
  },
  {
   "start": 36.56,
   "end": 39.86,
   "text": "a large enough area that it doesn't do much more than leave footprints in a lot of gardens.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.141,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.02
  },
  {
   "start": 40.3,
   "end": 44.1,
   "text": "The sound of 12 billion feet hitting the ground does create a loud, drawn-out roar",
   "avg_logprob": -0.141,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.02
  },
  {
   "start": 44.1,
   "end": 45.36,
   "text": "which lasts many seconds.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.141,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.02
  },
  {
   "start": 46.24,
   "end": 47.4,
   "text": "Eventually, the air grows quiet.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.141,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.02
  },
  {
   "start": 47.88,
   "end": 50.94,
   "text": "Outside Rhode Island, abandoned machinery begins grinding to a halt.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.141,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.02
  },
  {
   "start": 51.3,
   "end": 53.68,
   "text": "Airplanes drift through the skies on autopilot trajectories.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.141,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.02
  },
  {
   "start": 54.14,
   "end": 56.22,
   "text": "Food starts burning on abandoned kitchen stoves.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.141,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.02
  },
  {
   "start": 56.22,
   "end": 59.36,
   "text": "Soccer balls complete their trajectories into now-vacant goals.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.16,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.01
  },
  {
   "start": 59.66,
   "end": 61.86,
   "text": "And empty playground swings gradually drift to a halt.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.16,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.01
  },
  {
   "start": 62.22,
   "end": 65.44,
   "text": "Back in Rhode Island, people, many people, begin to wonder,",
   "avg_logprob": -0.16,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.01
  },
  {
   "start": 66.06,
   "end": 67.3,
   "text": "how do we get everyone home?",
   "avg_logprob": -0.16,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.01
  },
  {
   "start": 67.86,
   "end": 69.84,
   "text": "The TF Green Airport in Warwick, Rhode Island,",
   "avg_logprob": -0.16,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.01
  },
  {
   "start": 69.94,
   "end": 71.56,
   "text": "handles a few thousand passengers a day.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.16,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.01
  },
  {
   "start": 71.78,
   "end": 75.08,
   "text": "Assuming they got things organized, they could run at 500% capacity for",
   "avg_logprob": -0.16,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.01
  },
  {
   "start": 75.08,
   "end": 77.08,
   "text": "100 years without making a dent in the crowd.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.16,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.01
  },
  {
   "start": 77.58,
   "end": 80.16,
   "text": "Crowds climb on board container ships in the deepwater port of Providence.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.16,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.01
  },
  {
   "start": 80.4,
   "end": 83.54,
   "text": "But stocking sufficient food and water for a long-sea voyage proves a challenge.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.16,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.01
  },
  {
   "start": 83.86,
   "end": 85.74,
   "text": "Rhode Island's million cars are commandeered.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.16,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.01
  },
  {
   "start": 85.74,
   "end": 91.64,
   "text": "Moments later, I-95, I-195, and I-295 become the sites of the largest traffic jams in the history of the planet.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.108,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.008
  },
  {
   "start": 92.12,
   "end": 94.62,
   "text": "Some make it past New York or Boston before running out of fuel.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.108,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.008
  },
  {
   "start": 95.02,
   "end": 97.22,
   "text": "Since the electricity is probably not on at this point,",
   "avg_logprob": -0.108,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.008
  },
  {
   "start": 97.4,
   "end": 101.1,
   "text": "rather than finding a working gas pump, it's easier to just abandon the car and get in a new one.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.108,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.008
  },
  {
   "start": 101.38,
   "end": 102.34,
   "text": "After all, who can stop you?",
   "avg_logprob": -0.108,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.008
  },
  {
   "start": 102.46,
   "end": 103.56,
   "text": "All the cops are in Rhode Island.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.108,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.008
  },
  {
   "start": 103.98,
   "end": 106.14,
   "text": "Even if people cooperate, everyone is hungry and thirsty.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.108,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.008
  },
  {
   "start": 106.62,
   "end": 109.78,
   "text": "Fresh water is hard to come by and there's no efficient system for distributing it.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.108,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.008
  },
  {
   "start": 110.24,
   "end": 112.94,
   "text": "Sanitation is a disaster and healthcare infrastructure nonexistent.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.108,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.008
  },
  {
   "start": 113.54,
   "end": 115.86,
   "text": "Within weeks, Rhode Island is a graveyard of billions.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.162,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.189
  },
  {
   "start": 116.32,
   "end": 119.42,
   "text": "Including most of the people who submitted this question, probably you and me too.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.162,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.189
  },
  {
   "start": 119.8,
   "end": 123.32,
   "text": "And, most importantly, the Earth's rotation and orbit are completely unaffected.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.162,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.189
  },
  {
   "start": 123.84,
   "end": 127.24,
   "text": "It spins along exactly as it did before our species-wide jump.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.162,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.189
  },
  {
   "start": 127.8,
   "end": 128.9,
   "text": "Note to future civilizations.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.162,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.189
  },
  {
   "start": 129.76,
   "end": 130.82,
   "text": "Let's not try that again.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.162,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.189
  }
 ],
